{"author": "ValWood", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0006489 dolichyl diphosphate biosynthetic process\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29877\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/13oNsCNrIDGH26TAKCvpDW2QJXT_0vsR0g4qMKygR_b4/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \n\nComplexPortal 3 \nReactome 3\nUniProt 6 (automated migration to GO:0043048 dolichyl monophosphate biosynthetic process )\n\n(dolichyl diphosphate is an intermediate in the synthesis of dolichyl monophosphate)\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \n\nGO:0006489 | reactome2go | Reactome:R-HSA-446199 > GO:dolichyl diphosphate biosynthetic process ; GO:0006489\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-06-02T07:02:56Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0006489 dolichyl diphosphate biosynthetic process", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-06-04T14:08:11Z"}
